Migration priority
Priority	Action
P0	Create primitives.css — all color, spacing, radius, shadow, type primitives
P0	Create semantic-light.css — map every semantic token to its primitive
P0	Create components.css — Button, Input, Card (appear on every screen)
P1	Migrate Modal, Badge, Nav, Table, Menu, Header component tokens
P1	Replace all raw hex values page-by-page with var(--fp-...) references
P2	Add semantic-dark.css (same names, different primitive mappings)
P2	Add component metadata for documentation
Rules
Never skip tiers. Pages → component tokens → semantic tokens → primitives
Theme-stable names — no light- or dark- in token names
Warm-gray neutrals only — no Tailwind gray/zinc/slate substitutes for main UI
Monochrome primary — #191919 is the primary action color, not blue
Honor prefers-reduced-motion
WCAG 4.5:1 contrast for normal text, 3:1 for large text and controls